# Flutter client is not the source of truth

```
// BAD
if (kDebugMode) _setPremium(true); // also runs if you forget the flag in release
premium.isPremium = true; // from a Firestore user doc the client wrote

// GOOD
executePurchaseWeekly() talks to StoreKit / Play Billing
kDebugMode && AppConfig.debugPremium is the only stub, default false
```

- Entitlement: `PremiumController.canUseFreeTier` before Gemini. Refund the free use on throw.
- Do not persist `isPremium` from a client-writable user document.
- `String.fromEnvironment('GEMINI_API_KEY')` is inside the IPA/AAB. Rotate if leaked. Do not commit keys.
- Support/privacy emails come from `AppConfig` or `public_contacts`. Never read `nojic_mailboxes` from the app.
- Camera/photo usage strings required if you pick images. No extra PII collection.
